OL,11,G0000 Bangers & Cash
OL,12,     FBentley S3/Fiesta XR2: Anglophile
OL,13,     FDerek struggles to get his message
OL,14,     Facross on a rare trip abroad to
OL,15,     Fpick up a Bentley, while a
OL,16,     Fwell-restored Ford XR2 sets the
OL,17,     Fauction alight.
OL,18,G0100 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,19,     FSimon O'Brien turns tank parts
OL,20,     Finto garden furniture, while Henry
OL,21,     FCole takes his life in his hands
OL,22,     Fwith a motorised skateboard.
